### **4. Frontend Settings Loader - CREATED ✅**

**File:** `assets/js/settings-loader.js`

Features:
- ✅ Fetches settings from API
- ✅ Caches for 5 minutes
- ✅ Auto-applies to UI elements with special classes:
  - `.dynamic-library-name` → Gets library name from settings
  - `.dynamic-library-logo` → Gets logo path from settings
- ✅ Fallback to defaults if API fails
- ✅ Event-driven updates (`settings-updated` event)

**Global API:**
```javascript
// In any page
await window.librarySettings.fetch(); // Get all settings
await window.librarySettings.get('library_name'); // Get one setting
await window.librarySettings.apply(); // Reapply to UI
await window.librarySettings.refresh(); // Force refresh
```

